{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/android' data-target='computer\/programming\/android' data-title='Android'>\r\n\t\t\tAndroid\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/android\/build' data-target='computer\/programming\/android\/build' data-title='Build'>\r\n\t\t\tBuild\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on build.gradle: Android, packagingOptions, defaultConfig, signingConfigs, buildTypes, and release.","label":"build.gradle","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/android\/build\/build_variants","label":"Build variants","url":"\/computer\/programming\/android\/build\/build_variants"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on build.gradle: Android, packagingOptions, defaultConfig, signingConfigs, buildTypes, and release.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Android<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Android { compileSdkVersion &lt;&gt;\nAndroid { buildToolsVersion &lt;&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>packagingOptions<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>packagingOptions { [Exclude &lt;path&gt;]...\n}.<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>defaultConfig<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>defaultConfig { applicationId &lt;&gt;\ndefaultConfig { minSdkVersion &lt;&gt;\ndefaultConfig { targetSdkVersion &lt;&gt;\ndefaultConfig { versionCode &lt;&gt;\ndefaultConfig { versionName &lt;&gt;\ndefaultConfig { multiDexEnabled &lt;&gt;\n}.\nProductFlavors {.\n&lt;flavour&gt; {\n}...\napplicationId &lt;&gt;\napplicationId resValue \u201c&lt;type&gt;\u201d, \u201c&lt;var&gt;\u201d, \u201c&lt;value&gt;\u201d\nresValue def final &lt;var&gt; = \u201c&lt;value&gt;\u201d\ndef manifestPlaceholders = [&lt;var&gt;: &lt;value&gt;]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>signingConfigs<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>signingConfigs { &lt;flavour&gt; {\nstoreFile file(\"&lt;path&gt;\u201d)\nstoreFile storePassword \"&lt;&gt;\u201d\nstorePassword keyAlias \u201c&lt;&gt;\u201d\nkeyAlias keyPassword \u201c&lt;&gt;\u201d\n}.\n}.<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>buildTypes<\/h2>\n\t<h2>release<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>release { productFlavors.&lt;flavor1&gt;.signingConfig signingConfigs.&lt;config1&gt;\nrelease { productFlavors.&lt;flavor2&gt;.signingConfig signingConfigs.&lt;config2&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMinifyEnabled true.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>proguardFiles getDefaultProguardFile('proguard-android.txt'),<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t'proguard-rules.pro'.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>}.\n}.\n}.<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/android\/build\/build_gradle\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/android\/build\/build_gradle\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-sh